<ServicePage title="Renovations & extensions" heading="Renovations and extensions"
  description="Kitchen and bathroom renovations, room additions and extensions across Noosa and the Sunshine Coast by a QBCC licensed builder."
  intro="Kitchens, bathrooms, room additions and extensions. One builder looking after the job from the first site visit to handover."
  trades={['Extensions & renovations', 'Bathrooms & ensuites', 'Kitchens & joinery']}
  cta="Planning a renovation or extension? Tell us what you have in mind.">
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Kitchen renovations</li>
    <li>Bathroom and ensuite renovations</li>
    <li>Room additions and extensions</li>
    <li>Internal changes: walls moved, rooms opened up, new layouts</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How a job runs</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><strong>Site visit.</strong> We come out, look at the house and talk through what you want.</li>
    <li><strong>Scope and quote.</strong> You get a written scope of works and a quote, so you know what is and isn't included.</li>
    <li><strong>Plans and approvals.</strong> Where the work needs drawings or building approval, we work with your designer and certifier, or point you to people we know.</li>
    <li><strong>The build.</strong> We run the job and organise the trades.</li>
    <li><strong>Handover.</strong> We walk through the finished work with you.</li>
  </ol>
